    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'omukazi Omusamaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Yesu obu yamanyire nkooku Abafalisaayo bahuliire naatendeka abeegesebwa kandi naabatiza baingi kukira Yohaana ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Yesu wenka noobu araaba atarabatiize, baitu abeegesebwa be nubo baabatiize), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaruga Buyudaaya yagaruka Galiraaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki kikamuhambiriza kuraba ogwa Samaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.33.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 33:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 24:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo yahikire ati omu rubuga rwa Samaliya orurukwetwa Siikari, haihi n'ekibanja Yakobbo eki akaba ahaire mutabani we Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kiikaro eki hakaba harumu iziba lya Yakobbo. Kandi Yesu habw'okujwahibwa orugendo yaikarra ha rubaju rw'iziba. Zikaba ziri nka saaha mukaaga omu ihangwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaija omukazi Omusamaliya kutaha amaizi. Yesu yamusaba ati: “Mpa amaizi nnyweho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, abeegesebwa be bakaba bagenzire omu rubuga kugura ebyokulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.4.1+EZR.4.2+EZR.4.3+EZR.4.4+EZR.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezir 4:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi Omusamaliya yamukaguza ati: “Kisoboka kita iwe Omuyudaaya kunsaba eky'okunywa, kunu nyowe ndi Musamaliya?” Habwokuba Abayudaaya tibateerana n'Abasamaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugarukamu ati: “Kakuba omanyire ekisembo kya Ruhanga n'ogu arukukusaba ati: ‘Mpa amaizi nnyweho’, na iwe waakumusabire akuhe amaizi g'obwomeezi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo omukazi kumukaguza ati: “Waitu k'otaina eky'okutahisa, kandi n'iziba lihamire; amaizi ago ag'obwomeezi noija kugaiha nkaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe nookira isenkuru itwe Yakobbo ayatuhaire iziba linu, uwe wenka eri yanywahoga n'abaana be, akeeseraho n'ente ze?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugarukamu ati: “Weena anyakunywa ha maizi ganu, aligaruka kukwatwa iroho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu weena alinywa ha maizi aga ndimuha, ogu taligaruka kukwatwa iroho ebiro byona. Amaizi aga ndimuha galifooka omuli uwe nsoro y'amaizi agarukugera okumuhikya omu bwomeezi obutahwaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yamugambira ati: “Waitu mpaho amaizi ago, nukwo ndeke kukwatwaga iroho n'okugaruka hanu kuleeta amaizi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugambira ati: “Genda oyete baro, ogaruke hanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nandiki omukazi ati: “Tinyina iba nyowe.” Yesu yamugambira ati: “Obalize ekihikire kugamba oti: ‘Tinyina iba nyowe’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba okaswerwa abasaija bataano, kandi n'ow'oinawe hati, na uwe tali baro. Eki obalize ky'amazima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yamugambira ati: “Waitu, nyetegeriize nkooku oli murangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisenkuru itwe baaramizaaga ha rusozi runu; baitu inywe mugamba ngu, Yerusaalemu nikyo kiikaro abantu eki basemeriire kuramizamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugarukamu ati: “Mukazi iwe, onyikirize, habwokuba akasumi nikaija kuhika aka mutaliramizaamu Isenyowe ha rusozi runu, noobu haakuba omu Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe muramya eki mutarukumanya; baitu itwe turamya eki turukumanya, habwokuba okujunwa kuruga omu Bayudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu akasumi kali haihi, kandi nuko kanu, abaramya omu mazima aka baliramizaamu Isenyowe omu mwoyo n'omu mazima; abaramya bati, nubo Ruhanga asiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga aba mwoyo, kandi abo abamuramya nibasemerra okumuramya omu mwoyo n'omu mazima.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo omukazi kumugambira ati: “Mmanyire Mesiya (nuwe ogu Mukama ou yakomere namuseesaho amagita) nkooku ali w'okwija kandi obu aliija alitumanyisa ebintu byona.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugambira ati: “Nyowe arukubaza na iwe, ninyowe ogu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako abeegesebwa be baagaruka, baahunirra habw'okumusanga naabaza n'omukazi, baitu busaho n'omu ayamukagwize ati: “Obaire noomugonzaaho ki?” Rundi ati: “Habwaki obaire noobaza na uwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi yasigaho ensoha ye, yagaruka omu rubuga, yagambira abantu ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwije murole omusaija angambiire byona ebi nakozire. Ogu taakuba Kristo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbo baaruga omu rubuga, baija nambere Yesu ali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, abeegesebwa be baamwesengereza bati: “Mwegesa, ebyokulya mbinu, lyaaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe yabagarukamu ati: “Nyowe nyina ebyokulya inywe ebi mutarukumanya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo abeegesebwa be kukaguzangana bati: “Haroho anyakumuleetiire ebyokulya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nandiki Yesu ati: “Ebyokulya byange nukwo kukora Ogu ayantumire ebi agonza, n'okuhikiriza omulimo gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe timurukugamba ngu: ‘Hakyasigaire ameezi ana, igesa lihike’? Nyowe nimbagambira nti: Mwimukye amaiso ganyu, murole emisiri nkooku eyezire, ehikire kugeswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu anyakugesa aheebwa empeera kandi asorooza ebijuma eby'okumuhikya omu bwomeezi obutahwaho, nukwo omusigi n'omugesi basemererwe hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo orufumo ruhikira orurukugamba ruti: ‘Omu asiga, ondi agesa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabatuma kugesa eki mutaratalibaniire; abandi bakatalibana, baitu inywe mwaija, mwabagana ha kutalibana kwabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasamaliya baingi ab'omu rubuga oru bakamwikiriza habw'ebi omukazi yababaliize ati: “Angambiire byona ebi nakakozire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasamaliya obu baamuhikireho, baamwesengereza aikale nabo; nawe nukwo kumarayo ebiro bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebigambo bye bikaleetera abandi baingi okwikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagambira omukazi oli bati: “Titukyaikiriza habw'ebi watugambiire byonka, baitu twehuliriire itwenka, twamanya ngu, onu nuwe Mujuni w'ensi mali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro bibiri obu byahingwireho, yarugayo yagenda Galiraaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.13.57"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 13:57",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 6:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu wenka akakigumya ngu, Omurangi tagira kitiinisa omunsi y'owaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu yahikireyo, Abagaliraaya bakamutangirra habw'okurora byona ebi yakoliire Yerusaalemu. Nabo bakaba bagenzireyo habw'obugenyi bukuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza mutabani w'omunyoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.2.1+JHN.2.2+JHN.2.3+JHN.2.4+JHN.2.5+JHN.2.6+JHN.2.7+JHN.2.8+JHN.2.9+JHN.2.10+JHN.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 2:1-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairrayo yahika Kana orw'omu Galiraaya, nambere yahinduliire amaizi yagafoora viini. Kandi Kafaranaumu hakaba haliyo omunyoro ow'akaba aina mutabani we arwaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu yahuliire Yesu nkooku arugire Buyudaaya aizire Galiraaya, yagenda yamusaba aije akize mutabani we, habwokuba akaba ali haihi n'okufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yesu yamugambira ati: “Obu mutarora ebihuniriza n'ebyamahano, timwikiriza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyoro yamwesengereza ati: “Waitu, hikayo omwana wange atakacwekaine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yamugambira ati: “Irooko otaahe, omwana waawe akizire.” Omusaija yaikiriza Yesu eki yamugambiire, yagenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu akaba naagarukayo, abaheereza be baamutangaana baamugambira omwana we nkooku akizire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabakaguza esaaha yatandikiireho kuba kurungi. Nandiki bbo bati: “Ijo ha saaha musanju nubwo omuswija gwamurugireho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise omwana yamanya ngu, niyo saaha Yesu yamugambiiremu ati: “Omwana waawe akizire.” Na uwe wenka yaikiriza n'ab'omuka ye boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 4:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo ekirukuhuniriza ekya kabiri Yesu yakozire obu yarugire Buyudaaya agarukire Galiraaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.4.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.4.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
